msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Bayes Factor design allows you to design fixed sample size experiments for "
"conclusive evidence."
msgstr ""
"El diseño de factores de Bayes le permite diseñar experimentos de tamaño "
"muestral fijo para evidencia concluyente."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "References"
msgstr "Referencias"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "R Packages"
msgstr "Paquetes de R"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Statistical test:"
msgstr "Contraste estadístico:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Select the statistical test for which the Bayes factor design is planned."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar el contraste estadístico para el que se planó el diseño de los "
"factores de Bayes."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Independent Samples T-Test"
msgstr "Contraste T para muestras independientes"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Paired Samples T-Test"
msgstr "Contraste T para muestras emparejadas"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "One Sample T-Test"
msgstr "Contraste T para una muestra"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Independent Samples Z-Test"
msgstr "Contraste Z para muestras independientes"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Paired Samples Z-Test"
msgstr "Contraste Z para muestras emparejadas"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "One Sample Z-Test"
msgstr "Contraste Z para una muestra"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "One Sample Proportion Test"
msgstr "Contraste de proporciones para una muestra"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "General (z-approximation)"
msgstr "General (aproximación Z)"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Explanatory notes"
msgstr "Notas explicativas"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Append brief interpretation notes to each displayed Bayesian result."
msgstr ""
"Añadir breves notas de interpretación a cada resultado bayesiano presentado."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Generate report"
msgstr "Generar informe"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Generate a short report describing the design, priors, thresholds, and "
"achieved probabilities."
msgstr ""
"Generar un breve informe que describe el diseño, las previas, los umbrales y "
"las probabilidades alcanzadas."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "LaTeX formatted output"
msgstr "Resultado con formato de LaTeX"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Format the generated report with LaTeX notation for use in manuscripts and "
"preregistrations."
msgstr ""
"Formatear el informe generado con notación de LaTeX, para usar en "
"manuscritos y preinscripciones."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parámetros"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Sample Size"
msgstr "Tamaño de la muestra"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Sample size in group 1:"
msgstr "Tamaño de la muestra en grupo 1:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Sample size:"
msgstr "Tamaño de la muestra:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "N"
msgstr "N"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Fixed sample size at which the probability of conclusive, misleading, and "
"inconclusive evidence is evaluated."
msgstr ""
"Tamaño muestral fijo en el que se evalúa la probabilidad de la evidencia "
"concluyente, confusa y no concluyente."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Allocation ratio (N₂/N₁):"
msgstr "Proporción de asignaciones (N₂/N₁):"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Ratio of the sample size in group 2 to the sample size in group 1."
msgstr ""
"Proporción del tamaño muestral del grupo 2 con el tamaño muestral del grupo "
"1."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "Tablas"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Design Results"
msgstr "Resultados de diseño"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Design summary"
msgstr "Resumen de diseño"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the main fixed-design result: the required sample size or the achieved "
"probability of conclusive evidence."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar el resultado principal del diseño fijo: el tamaño muestral requerido "
"o la probabilidad alcanzada de evidencia concluyente."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Decision probabilities"
msgstr "Probabilidades de decisiones"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show probabilities of evidence for H₁, evidence for H₀, and inconclusive "
"evidence under each design prior."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar las probabilidades de evidencia para H₁, evidencia para H₀ y "
"evidencia no concluyente bajo cada previa de diseño."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Design specification"
msgstr "Especificación de diseño"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the analysis and design priors used for computing and evaluating the "
"Bayes factor design."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar las previas de análisis y de diseño utilizadas para calcular y "
"evaluar el diseño de factores de Bayes."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "Gráficos"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Decision Probability"
msgstr "Probabilidad de la decisión"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Decision probabilities by effect size"
msgstr "Probabilidades de decisiones por magnitud del efecto"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Plot how conclusive, misleading, and inconclusive evidence probabilities "
"change across design-prior effect sizes."
msgstr ""
"Dibujar como cambian las probabilidades de evidencia concluyente, confusa y "
"no concluyente a través de las magnitudes del efecto de la previa de diseño."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Decision probabilities by sample size"
msgstr "Probabilidades de decisiones por tamaño muestral"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Plot how conclusive, misleading, and inconclusive evidence probabilities "
"change as the fixed sample size increases."
msgstr ""
"Dibujar como cambian las probabilidades de evidencia concluyente, confusa y "
"no concluyente a medida que aumenta la magnitud fija del efecto."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Log sample-size axis"
msgstr "Log del eje del tamaño muestral"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Use a logarithmic x-axis to inspect changes across small and large sample "
"sizes."
msgstr ""
"Utilizar un eje X logarítmico para inspeccionar cambios a través de tamaños "
"muestrales pequeños y grandes."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Combine H₁ and H₀"
msgstr "Combinar H₁ y H₀"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Display curves for the H₁ and H₀ design priors in one figure instead of "
"separate figures."
msgstr ""
"Presentar curvas para las previas de diseño de H₁ y H₀ en una imagen, en "
"lugar de imágenes separadas."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanzado"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Generate R code"
msgstr "Generar código de R"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Generate R code that reproduces the Bayes factor design calculation."
msgstr ""
"Generar código de R que reproduce el cálculo del diseño de factores de Bayes."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Minimum sample size:"
msgstr "Mínimo tamaño muestral:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Nmin"
msgstr "Nmín"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Smallest sample size considered when searching for the target probability of "
"conclusive evidence."
msgstr ""
"Menor tamaño muestral considerado cuando se busca la probabilidad objetivo "
"de la evidencia concluyente."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Maximum sample size:"
msgstr "Máximo tamaño muestral:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Nmax"
msgstr "Nmáx"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Largest sample size considered when searching for the target probability of "
"conclusive evidence."
msgstr ""
"Mayor tamaño muestral considerado cuando se busca la probabilidad objetivo "
"de la evidencia concluyente."

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Curve points:"
msgstr "Puntos de curvas:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Number of points used to draw probability and prior curves."
msgstr ""
"Número de puntos utilizados para dibujar curvas de probabilidades y previas."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Bayes Factor sequential design allows you to design sequential experiments "
"for conclusive evidence."
msgstr ""
"El diseño secuencial de factores de Bayes permite diseñar experimentos "
"secuenciales para evidencia concluyente."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "References"
msgstr "Referencias"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "R Packages"
msgstr "Paquetes de R"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Statistical test:"
msgstr "Contraste estadístico:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Select the statistical test for which the Bayes factor sequential design is "
"planned."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar el contraste estadístico para el que se planea el diseño "
"secuencial de factores de Bayes."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Independent Samples T-Test"
msgstr "Contraste T para muestras independientes"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Paired Samples T-Test"
msgstr "Contraste T para muestras emparejadas"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "One Sample T-Test"
msgstr "Contraste T para una muestra"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Independent Samples Z-Test"
msgstr "Contraste Z para muestras independientes"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Paired Samples Z-Test"
msgstr "Contraste Z para muestras emparejadas"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "One Sample Z-Test"
msgstr "Contraste Z para una muestra"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "General (z-approximation)"
msgstr "General (aproximación Z)"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Explanatory notes"
msgstr "Notas explicativas"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Append brief interpretation notes to each displayed Bayesian result."
msgstr ""
"Añadir breves notas de interpretación a cada resultado bayesiano presentado."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Generate report"
msgstr "Generar informe"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Generate a short report describing the sequential design, priors, "
"thresholds, and achieved probabilities."
msgstr ""
"Generar un breve informe que describe el diseño secuencial, las previas, los "
"umbrales y las probabilidades alcanzadas."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "LaTeX formatted output"
msgstr "Resultado con formato de LaTeX"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Format the generated report with LaTeX notation for use in manuscripts and "
"preregistrations."
msgstr ""
"Formatear el informe generado con notación de LaTeX, para usar en "
"manuscritos y preinscripciones."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parámetros"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "Tablas"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Design Results"
msgstr "Resultados de diseño"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Design summary"
msgstr "Resumen de diseño"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the main sequential-design result: the maximum sample size or the "
"achieved probability of conclusive evidence."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar el resultado principal del diseño secuencial: el máximo tamaño "
"muestral o la probabilidad alcanzada de la evidencia concluyente."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Sample size summary"
msgstr "Resumen del tamaño muestral"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the expected sample size and its variability under each design prior."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar el tamaño muestral esperado y su variabilidad bajo cada previa de "
"diseño."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Decision probabilities"
msgstr "Probabilidades de decisiones"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show final probabilities of evidence for H₁, evidence for H₀, and "
"inconclusive evidence under each design prior."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar las probabilidades finales de evidencia para H₁, evidencia para H₀ y "
"evidencia no concluyente bajo cada previa de diseño."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Design specification"
msgstr "Especificación de diseño"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the analysis and design priors used for computing and evaluating the "
"Bayes factor sequential design."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar las previas de análisis y de diseño utilizadas para calcular y "
"evaluar el diseño secuencial de factores de Bayes."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Look-by-Look Results"
msgstr "Resultados apariencia a apariencia"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Cumulative decision probabilities"
msgstr "Probabilidades acumuladas de decisiones"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the probability that the study has stopped for each decision by each "
"planned look."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar la probabilidad de que el estudio se detuviese para cada decisión "
"por cada apariencia planeada."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Incremental decision probabilities"
msgstr "Probabilidades graduales de decisiones"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the probability that each decision is first reached at a given look."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar la probabilidade de que cada decisión sea la primera alcanzada en "
"una apariencia dada."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Stopping boundaries"
msgstr "Límites de detención"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the test-statistic values corresponding to the Bayes factor stopping "
"thresholds at each look."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar los valores de los estadísticos de prueba que corresponden con los "
"umbrales de detención de los factores de Bayes, para cada apariencia."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "Gráficos"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Decision Probability"
msgstr "Probabilidad de la decisión"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Plot how stopping probabilities for conclusive, misleading, and inconclusive "
"evidence accumulate across looks."
msgstr ""
"Dibujar cómo se acumulan las probabilidades de detención para la evidencia "
"concluyente, confusa y no concluyente, a través de las apariencias."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Plot the test-statistic boundaries that trigger stopping for H₁ or H₀ at "
"each look."
msgstr ""
"Dibujar los límites de los estadísticos de prueba que provocan la detención "
"para H₁ o H₀, en cada apariencia."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Combine H₁ and H₀"
msgstr "Combinar H₁ y H₀"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Display curves for the H₁ and H₀ design priors in one figure instead of "
"separate figures."
msgstr ""
"Presentar curvas para las previas de diseño de H₁ y H₀ en una imagen, en "
"lugar de imágenes separadas."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanzado"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Generate R Code"
msgstr "Generar código de R"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Generate R code that reproduces the Bayes factor sequential-design "
"calculation."
msgstr ""
"Generar código de R que reproduce el cálculo del diseño secuencial de "
"factores de Bayes."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Sample-size search:"
msgstr "Búsqueda del tamaño muestral:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Strategy"
msgstr "Estrategia"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Choose whether maximum sample-size search uses a faster adaptive search or "
"an exhaustive search that certifies the smallest maximum sample size."
msgstr ""
"Elegir si la búsqueda del máximo tamaño muestral utiliza una exploración "
"adaptativa más rápida o una exploración exhaustiva que certifique el máximo "
"tamaño muestral más pequeño."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Adaptive"
msgstr "Adaptativa"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Exhaustive"
msgstr "Exhaustiva"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Exact integration over all regions:"
msgstr "Integración exacta sobre todas las regiones:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Use exact integration over all decision regions when computing sequential "
"design characteristics."
msgstr ""
"Usar la integración exacta sobre todas las regiones de decisión cuando se "
"calculan características de diseño secuencial."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Integration method:"
msgstr "Método de integración:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Método"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Numerical method used for multivariate normal probabilities in sequential "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"Método numérico utilizado para las probabilidades de la Normal Multivariante "
"en cálculos secuenciales."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Log-scale MVN"
msgstr "MVN de log-escala"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "MVN"
msgstr "MVN"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Absolute tolerance:"
msgstr "Tolerancia absoluta:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "abs"
msgstr "Abs"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Absolute error tolerance for numerical integration."
msgstr "Tolerancia absoluta del error para la integración numérica."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Relative tolerance:"
msgstr "Tolerancia relativa:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "rel"
msgstr "Rel"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Relative error tolerance for numerical integration."
msgstr "Tolerancia relativa del error para la integración numérica."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Maximum integration points:"
msgstr "Máximos puntos de integración:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "max"
msgstr "Máx"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Maximum number of integration points used by the numerical routine."
msgstr ""
"Número máximo de puntos de integración utilizados por la rutina numérica."

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Curve points:"
msgstr "Puntos de curvas:"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "N"
msgstr "N"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Number of points used to draw probability and prior curves."
